      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544007EBCF4007E007E007E00100002011401BE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "세비퍼라서 이름도 ‘세비’란다!\n어떠냐, 정말 멋지지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C138BE44D37CB77CC11C0020C774B984B3C400202018C138BE442019B780B2E40021000AC5B4B5A0B0D0002C0020C815B9D00020BA4BC9C0C9C0003F00100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 애는 아보크예요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020C560B2940020C544BCF4D06CC608C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "세비퍼라구요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C138BE44D37CB77CAD6CC694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아보크라고?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n내 옆에 있는 포켓몬이?\n이건 누가 봐도 세비퍼이지 않으냐!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BCF4D06CB77CACE0003F00100001BE01000AB0B40020C606C5D00020C788B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC774003F000AC774AC740020B204AC000020BD10B3C40020C138BE44D37CC774C9C00020C54AC73CB0D0002100100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어째서 의심스러운 듯이 물어보는 거지?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n내 옆에 있는 포켓몬은\n누가 봐도 세비퍼이지 않으냐!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C9F8C11C0020C758C2ECC2A4B7ECC6B40020B4EFC7740020BB3CC5B4BCF4B2940020AC70C9C0003F00100001BE01000AB0B40020C606C5D00020C788B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC740000AB204AC000020BD10B3C40020C138BE44D37CC774C9C00020C54AC73CB0D0002100100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 나는 이해심이 많은 사람이니...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n정 의심스럽다면,\n진짜 세비퍼를 데려와 보거라!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
